68	Both $r_{\text{eff}}$ and SLV reverse after Gen~2 ($r_{\text{eff}}$: 496.2$\to$493.6, SLV: 2468$\to$2440), marking the transition from decompression to collapse while perplexity continues its monotonic rise.
